{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIG FAT PREFACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s early days for <strong>Mozentum</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until this preface is removed, please know: you\u2019re buying an <strong>unfinished</strong> experience\u2026 but one that I\u2019ll be working on with every <strong>ounce</strong> of spare time I have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the foreseeable future, I\u2019m committing to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivering a <strong>profound, expressive movement adventure</strong> with fortnightly (sometimes weekly\u2026 even <i>daily</i>) updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Providing <strong>full support</strong> \u2014 responding quickly and patching issues as soon as I can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making this thing as <strong>damn good</strong> as it was destined to be.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve purchased Mozentum this early \u2014 <strong>thank you</strong>. You\u2019re helping me live my dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes\u2026 there will be <strong>hidden prizes</strong> for early players.<br><i>(More info coming soon on my YouTube channel @stillzen-dev)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME DESCRIPTION</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/471db52627518240d153698c1b1639a3.poster.avif?t=1755917533\" width=780 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/471db52627518240d153698c1b1639a3.webm?t=1755917533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/471db52627518240d153698c1b1639a3.mp4?t=1755917533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>I want to spark that <strong>childlike sense of play and exploration</strong> in you. <br>Nothing more. <br>Nothing less.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Movement \u2014 But Really Good</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve built a movement system with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural grabbing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swinging</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse-based pulling power</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skill ceiling is <strong>ridiculously high</strong> \u2014 from mo(z)entum-based vaulting and unique sliding to diving, wallrunning, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, you\u2019ll be able to tweak <strong>power values</strong> and expand your <strong>skill list</strong>. If you find yourself addicted to swinging around for no reason, I\u2019ve done my job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/b1da40e3c3dc47bca32958913797fd24.poster.avif?t=1755917533\" width=780 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/b1da40e3c3dc47bca32958913797fd24.webm?t=1755917533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/b1da40e3c3dc47bca32958913797fd24.mp4?t=1755917533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It\u2019s a big, weird world \u2014 and you\u2019re oh so small.<br>Filled with:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranger people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and incense (lots of incense)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-mindedness is king, young tripper.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tools &amp; trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beings who love giving unsolicited advice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sick digs (clothes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe even enlightenment</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Themes &amp; Vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy.<br>Spirituality.<br>Zen.<br>The importance of huffing incense twice daily.<br>(Max Derrat, I love you.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roadmap &amp; Future Plans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mozentum\u2019s scope will grow over time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More quirky NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More interactivity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possible multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Van-life features (build your van, stink it up)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment (climbing gear, physics grapples, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/230ca0628193daf40fc37ffc65ddf71c.poster.avif?t=1755917533\" width=780 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/230ca0628193daf40fc37ffc65ddf71c.webm?t=1755917533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/extras/230ca0628193daf40fc37ffc65ddf71c.mp4?t=1755917533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Updated All the Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is my baby. I will update it constantly and give you everything I\u2019ve got.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE GIVE ME FEEDBACK.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ll reply directly whenever I can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All feedback is good feedback \u2014 just keep it clean, clear, and constructive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve gone through countless trials, broken builds, and total wipeouts to get Mozentum into your hands. It\u2019s been made on a $900 laptop by a guy living full-time in a van.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So\u2026 be ready.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2842670?t=1755917533","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2842670?t=1755917533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/69d744a0d644a4e0f1e746492788d8614da9890d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755917533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842670/69d744a0d644a4e0f1e746492788d8614da9890d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755917533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game's pretty chill. The worst that'll happen is you'll fight baddies and they'll eventually die, or maybe you'll hear me talk about the subject of sex as a conversational topic."},"demos":[{"appid":2865320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIG FAT PREFACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s early days for <strong>Mozentum</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until this preface is removed, please know: yo